mbai.The property belongs to Aditya Borivali Ranjaee Chs Ltd which is 13 years old. You can buy this ready to move apartment in Borivali West, at the price of ₹1.35 Cr. Occupying 2 floor, the flat offers carpet area 306 sqft. This stunning 2 BHK flat is located in Kastur Park, Shimpoli Road, Borivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra, India..   [View Property](/propertyDetails/2-BHK-425-Sq-ft-Multistorey-Apartment-FOR-Sale-Borivali-West-in-Mumbai&id=4d423735363736353439)\n\n![1 BHK Flat in Swapnil CHS in Borivali West](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"1 BHK Flat in Swapnil CHS in Borivali West\")\n\n## 1 BHK Flat for Sale in Borivali West, Mumbai\n\nAvailable for purchase is this beautiful 1 BHK apartment in Borivali West, Mumbai.Located in Swapnil Chs, this flat is equipped with premium facilities. This ready to move flat in Borivali West comes at a price of ₹1.05 Cr. Occupying 6 floor, the flat offers carpet area 396 sqft. The flat features reserved parking, security, visitor parking. Swapnil Chs, Vazira, Borivali west is the precise address of this 1 BHK flat.   [View Property](/propertyDetails/1-BHK-550-Sq-ft-Multistorey-Apartment-FOR-Sale-Borivali-West-in-Mumbai&id=4d423735363933323439)\n\n![2 BHK Flat in Shreeji Sharan Daivi Eterneety in Borivali West](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"2 BHK Flat in Shreeji Sharan Daivi Eterneety in Borivali West\")\n\n## 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n2 BHK flat available for sale in Mumbai in the prime location of Sai Baba Nagar.This unit forms part of Shreeji Sharan Daivi Eterneety which is 5 years old. This 2 BHK apartment comes with 1 covered parking space for your vehicle. This apartment in one of the significant areas of Sai Baba Nagar is under construction, and can be purchased at the price of ₹3.75 Cr. The possession date for this flat is Mar '27. Situated on 6 floor, the flat provides carpet area 876 sqft. The complex comprises 34 floor and provides Kids play area. The apartment provides power back up, security, service/goods lift, intercom facility. P51800029609 is the RERA number of the project. The project features 2,3,4 bhk flats properties, priced across the ₹2.65 Cr - ₹3.50 Cr range. Daivi Eterneety, opp. MKN Bhatia School, Sai Baba Nagar, Jai Bhim Sanjay Nagar, Borivali West, Mumbai, Maharashtra is the physical address of this 2 BHK apartment.  Nearby Landmark: jain derasar, haveli.   [View Property](/propertyDetails/2-BHK-1100-Sq-ft-Multistorey-Apartment-FOR-Sale-Sai-Baba-Nagar-in-Mumbai&id=4d423835383737313639)\n\n![2 BHK Flat in Vijay Nagar Chs in Borivali West](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"2 BHK Flat in Vijay Nagar Chs in Borivali West\")\n\n## 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Borivali West, Mumbai\n\nAvailable for purchase is this beautiful 2 BHK apartment in Borivali West, Mumbai.This flat is placed in a premium location within Vijay Nagar Chs. This ready to move flat in Borivali West comes at a price of ₹1.41 Cr. This unit occupies 5 floor with carpet area of total 396 sqft. The apartment provides power back up, reserved parking, security, intercom facility. Near Eksar Talao, Eksar Road, Borivali(West), Mumbai-400 092 is the physical address of this 2 BHK apartment.   [View Property](/propertyDetails/2-BHK-550-Sq-ft-Multistorey-Apartment-FOR-Sale-Borivali-West-in-Mumbai&id=4d423735363831323539)\n\n![](data:image/svg+xml;base64,)\n![locality image](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"locality image\")\n![locality image](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"locality image\")\n![locality image](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"locality image\")\n![locality image](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"locality image\")\n![locality image](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"locality image\")\n![locality image](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"locality image\")\n![locality image](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"locality image\")\n![locality image](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"locality image\")\n\n### About [Borivali West, Mumbai](https://www.magicbricks.com/Borivali-West-in-Mumbai-Overview)\n\nLocated in Mumbai's northwest, Borivali West is a vibrant fastest growing suburb in the city. This locality is extremely popular among families, working professionals, an...\n\nLocated in Mumbai's northwest, Borivali West is a vibrant fastest growing suburb in the city. This locality is extremely popular among families, working professionals, and retirees due to its beautiful natural surroundings, contemporary infrastructure, and good connections. \n\nThe real estate market in Borivali West offers a variety of assets, from budget-friendly apartments to opulent homes, appealing to varied preferences.\n\n### Transportation in Borivali West\n\nThe Western Express Highway and Link Road pass through Borivali, providing easy access to both the southern parts of Mumbai and the suburbs.\n\nBorivali Railway Station connect the area to the Western Line.\n\nMumbai Metro Line 2A connects Borivali West to Dahisar, Kandivali, and other suburbs.\n\nChhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj International Airport is just 18 km away form Borivali West.\n\nBEST buses, cabs, and autos are also available in the locality.\n\n### Educational Institutes in & around Borivali West\n\n### Healthcare in & around Borivali West\n\n### Shopping & Recreation in & around Borivali West\n\n### Borivali West, Mumbai\n\nIdeal Balance of Ease, Amenities, and Green Space\nBorivali West truly feels like home. Daily needs are covered with multiple malls, local markets, restaurants and places like Moksh Plaza. Connectivity via Borivali Railway, Western Express Highway saves hours. Weekend nature walks in SGNP or trips to Gorai Beach are my family’s highlight.\n\nGreen & Connected Suburb Living Borivali West blends city convenience with nature - Sanjay Gandhi National Park on weekends, excellent schools, hospitals, and easy metro and rail connectivity make daily life effortless.\n\nGreen & Connected Suburb Living Borivali West blends city convenience with nature - Sanjay Gandhi National Park on weekends, excellent schools, hospitals, and easy metro and rail connectivity make daily life effortless.\n\nFamily-Friendly Yet Vibrant Locale\nAs a family resident, I love the strong social infrastructure here - Don Bosco, Swami Vivekanand schools, good hospitals, Indraprastha market, and parks.\n\n## Flats Price Trend in Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n|  |  |  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Quarter | Borivali West  (% Change in Q-o-Q) | Mathuradas Road  (% Change in Q-o-Q) | Chandavarkar Road  (% Change in Q-o-Q) | Borivali  (% Change in Q-o-Q) |\n| Apr-June'26 | ₹ 25003/ sq.ft3% | -- | ₹ 25118/ sq.ft3% | ₹ 24530/ sq.ft2% |\n| Jan-Mar'26 | ₹ 24363/ sq.ft2% | -- | ₹ 24316/ sq.ft2% | ₹ 24001/ sq.ft2% |\n| Oct-Dec'25 | ₹ 23914/ sq.ft-1% | -- | ₹ 23764/ sq.ft-2% | ₹ 23455/ sq.ft-1% |\n| Jul-Sept'25 | ₹ 24273/ sq.ft-4% | -- | ₹ 24149/ sq.ft-3% | ₹ 23772/ sq.ft-2% |\n\n|  |  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Year | Borivali West  (% Change in Y-o-Y) | Chandavarkar Road  (% Change in Y-o-Y) | Borivali  (% Change in Y-o-Y) |\n| 2025 | ₹ 24498/ sq.ft11% | ₹ 24455/ sq.ft12% | ₹ 23146/ sq.ft11% |\n| 2024 | ₹ 22004/ sq.ft11% | ₹ 21902/ sq.ft8% | ₹ 20913/ sq.ft9% |\n| 2023 | ₹ 19895/ sq.ft3% | -- | ₹ 19183/ sq.ft4% |\n\n|  |  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Year | Borivali West  (% Change in Y-o-Y) | Chandavarkar Road  (% Change in Y-o-Y) | Borivali  (% Change in Y-o-Y) |\n| 2025 | ₹ 24498/ sq.ft11% | ₹ 24455/ sq.ft12% | ₹ 23146/ sq.ft11% |\n| 2024 | ₹ 22004/ sq.ft11% | ₹ 21902/ sq.ft8% | ₹ 20913/ sq.ft9% |\n| 2023 | ₹ 19895/ sq.ft3% | -- | ₹ 19183/ sq.ft4% |\n| 2022 | ₹ 19244/ sq.ft4% | -- | ₹ 18486/ sq.ft3% |\n| 2021 | ₹ 18518/ sq.ft4% | -- | ₹ 17888/ sq.ft5% |\n\n## Newly Posted Flats for sale in Borivali West\n\n![520 Sq-ft 1 BHK Flat](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"520 Sq-ft 1 BHK Flat\")\n![600 Sq-ft 2 BHK Flat](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"600 Sq-ft 2 BHK Flat\")\n![872 Sq-ft 3 BHK Flat](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"872 Sq-ft 3 BHK Flat\")\n![840 Sq-ft 2 BHK Flat](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"840 Sq-ft 2 BHK